\p{The arrows from Euclidean time enter the transfer chapter; those
from lattice fermions enter the Dirac-Kähler chapter. They mark selected
intended prerequisites for the chapters below, while the two opening
questions motivate the part as a whole. Other suppliers are specified
when each construction is developed.}

